This directory contains tests that mostly require manual inspection of the
results. GRandomUsage and DependentDistributionTests write files from which the
ROOT analysis toolkit (http://root.cern.ch) draws random number distributions,
for a look by eye.

GRandomThroughput measures raw proxy throughput for a single random-number
source (--source), but is sort-bound and does not differentiate the sources.

The histograms of hap's distributions that the manual prints are drawn by the
documentation program plot_rng_distributions in ../../docprograms.
